# Unreviewed first-run output.
#
# README.md is explicit that a `*.pending-review.json` file never participates in
# comparison: it only becomes a baseline when a human copies it to
# `<model>_<chip>.json` or re-runs with `--update-golden`.  Committing it would
# present raw machine output as a reviewed baseline, so it stays out of the tree
# -- the same reasoning that makes `_reports/` ignore everything next door.
*.pending-review.json
